 hike: cable car up 643 m Ulriken, then 4 to 6 hours over the open plateau to Floyen and the funicular down.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://en.visitbergen.com/things-to-do/vidden-hike-from-ulriken-to-floyen-p984113","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":23,"urls":["https://en.visitbergen.com/things-to-do/vidden-hike-from-ulriken-to-floyen-p984113","https://ulriken643.no/en/blog/vidden-turen-slik-gar-du-fra-ulriken-til-floyen","https://www.visitnorway.com/listings/vidden-hike-from-ulriken-to-floyen/23645/","https://www.studybergen.com/guide-to-bergen/outdoor-activities/vidden-1"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Floibanen funicular up Mount Floyen","type":"activity","detail":"Eight minutes from the centre to a 320 m summit with harbour views, a troll forest for kids and trails onward into the hills.","link":"https://en.visitbergen.com/things-to-do/floibanen-funicular-p822813","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":23,"urls":["https://en.visitbergen.com/things-to-do/floibanen-funicular-p822813","https://diycruiseports.com/diy-port-guides/bergen-cruise-port-diy-guide","https://pierstop.com/blog/bergen-cruise-guide","https://www.48hoursineurope.com/thebestofbergen"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Wander the Bryggen wharf","type":"experience","detail":"The leaning wooden trading houses of the UNESCO Hanseatic wharf hide galleries and workshops in their back alleys.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":23,"urls":["https://en.visitbergen.com/things-to-do/bryggen-in-bergen-p878553","https://oranatravel.com/visit/bergen/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g190502-Activities-Bergen_Hordaland_Western_Norway.html","https://www.nomadicmatt.com/travel-blogs/things-to-see-and-do-bergen/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Seafood lunch at the Fish Market","type":"experience","detail":"Fisketorget stalls sell locally caught salmon, king crab and fish soup by the harbour, a short walk from Bryggen.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":23,"urls":["https://en